Revert arm of scripts/demo/d440a-check.sh (#462 PR 3c): the gNB still asks its
NWDAF for the recommendation and logs it, but sends the UE Context Release
Complete without the Information on Recommended Cells and RAN Nodes for Paging
IE (TS 38.413 §9.3.1.100). amfd, under paging.strategy recommended-first, then
has nothing to page first and pages the whole registration area, so the check
must fail at amf step 1/2 (the recommended gNBs paged first). Needs a gNB
rebuilt with the patch applied (ci.yml demo-d440a runs it last).

  scripts/demo/revert-run.sh --expect "[amf] step 1/2 missing" \
      scripts/demo/reverts/d440a-no-ie.patch -- <rebuild the gNB> && scripts/demo/d440a-check.sh ct 1

diff --git a/nextgsim-gnb/src/ngap/task.rs b/nextgsim-gnb/src/ngap/task.rs
index 167ffd7..f4567cf 100644
--- a/nextgsim-gnb/src/ngap/task.rs
+++ b/nextgsim-gnb/src/ngap/task.rs
@@ -2874,7 +2874,7 @@ impl NgapTask {
         let mut complete_params = UeContextReleaseCompleteParams {
             amf_ue_ngap_id,
             ran_ue_ngap_id,
-            recommended_paging,
+            recommended_paging: { let _ = recommended_paging; None },
         };
 
         let mut encoded = encode_ue_context_release_complete(&complete_params);
